sequenceDiagram
    title Agent 登录请求时序
    participant Browser
    participant AgentAPI
    participant SessionStore
    participant ReplayCache
    participant Orchestrator
    participant DomainServices
    participant Provider

    Browser->>AgentAPI: POST chat with requestId
    AgentAPI->>SessionStore: Load owned history
    SessionStore-->>AgentAPI: Bounded history
    AgentAPI->>ReplayCache: Check fingerprint
    ReplayCache-->>AgentAPI: Miss
    AgentAPI->>Orchestrator: Respond with context
    Orchestrator->>DomainServices: Search Learning and Tools
    DomainServices-->>Orchestrator: Safe cards and citations
    Orchestrator->>Provider: Generate from evidence
    Provider-->>Orchestrator: Answer and usage
    Orchestrator-->>AgentAPI: Validated structured response
    AgentAPI->>SessionStore: Append final exchange
    AgentAPI->>ReplayCache: Store completed response
    AgentAPI-->>Browser: JSON or SSE completed
